# Cutover from plan-t.org.il (PR F). Cloudflare Workers static-assets
# _redirects — same format and location as _headers. First match wins.
#
# Path-only sources: Workers static assets do not support domain-level
# sources, so the old-hostname catch-all is a Redirect Rule on the
# plan-t.org.il zone — docs/cutover-runbook.md §2.
#
# Hebrew sources are PERCENT-ENCODED ONLY. Verified in production on
# 02/09/2026: Cloudflare matches the encoded request path, so a raw-UTF-8
# source line never matches (curl with raw bytes -> 404, encoded -> 301).
# Browsers always send the encoded form, so this is what visitors hit.
# Raw lines were dead weight and are gone. The Hebrew is kept as a comment
# beside each encoded line so the file stays readable.
#
# Every target is absolute to the new host: one hop from either hostname.

